	"smallSizeObservation": {
		"en": "At 128/64 px the checker rhythm, rounded thickness and hover shadow remain clear. At 32/24/16 px the transparent mark retains the alternating block silhouette; fine bevel reflections and drafting lines are deliberately left to the large presentation.",
		"zh": "128/64 px 保留棋盘节奏、圆润厚度与悬浮阴影；32/24/16 px 透明图标以黑白交错轮廓为主，精细倒角反光与工程格线留给大尺寸展示。"
